    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/e6c9256289ad6fa894d2b2f0a0a1a560.avif?t=1749814046\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomic Heart 2 is an action-adventure role-playing game set in a living world, rich with possibilities and a heavy emphasis on the story, role-playing elements, and player freedom. The sequel to Atomic Heart relates new events unfolding in the retrofuturistic universe of an alternate history. This time, the action takes place on a global scale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/4bc6ea2fb3ef4d5cf5605163f6ad6b5b.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/4bc6ea2fb3ef4d5cf5605163f6ad6b5b.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/4bc6ea2fb3ef4d5cf5605163f6ad6b5b.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get ready for dangerous new adventures that will redefine the gameplay experience and raise the bar for the genre's capabilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/0afa7525c098a449fe8019ea6d6b785f.avif?t=1749814046\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dystopia and retrofuturism with realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/ff7c94347feda3b54a54e704fdfca8a8.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/ff7c94347feda3b54a54e704fdfca8a8.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/ff7c94347feda3b54a54e704fdfca8a8.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded RPG system allows you to immerse yourself in the living game world full of various activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/7cb05595452a2c1ea383991e90d40ef7.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/7cb05595452a2c1ea383991e90d40ef7.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/7cb05595452a2c1ea383991e90d40ef7.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A continuation of the story with an enthralling plot brimming with mysteries and high stakes. Our beloved characters return, while new ones help reveal a different side of the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/2b98c1d3f0d8273c0ab7c641820752ae.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/2b98c1d3f0d8273c0ab7c641820752ae.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/2b98c1d3f0d8273c0ab7c641820752ae.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The re-engineered and enhanced combat system lets you use both hands at once. Glove abilities can be combined with various melee and ranged weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/9533b683dbdf065e411f7b3df88ce452.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/9533b683dbdf065e411f7b3df88ce452.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/9533b683dbdf065e411f7b3df88ce452.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the magnificent world of science and technology, and find out what the next chapter has in store for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/0afa7525c098a449fe8019ea6d6b785f.avif?t=1749814046\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/e6c9256289ad6fa894d2b2f0a0a1a560.avif?t=1749814046\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomic Heart 2 is an action-adventure role-playing game set in a living world, rich with possibilities and a heavy emphasis on the story, role-playing elements, and player freedom. The sequel to Atomic Heart relates new events unfolding in the retrofuturistic universe of an alternate history. This time, the action takes place on a global scale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/4bc6ea2fb3ef4d5cf5605163f6ad6b5b.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/4bc6ea2fb3ef4d5cf5605163f6ad6b5b.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/4bc6ea2fb3ef4d5cf5605163f6ad6b5b.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get ready for dangerous new adventures that will redefine the gameplay experience and raise the bar for the genre's capabilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/0afa7525c098a449fe8019ea6d6b785f.avif?t=1749814046\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dystopia and retrofuturism with realistic graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/ff7c94347feda3b54a54e704fdfca8a8.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/ff7c94347feda3b54a54e704fdfca8a8.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/ff7c94347feda3b54a54e704fdfca8a8.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded RPG system allows you to immerse yourself in the living game world full of various activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/7cb05595452a2c1ea383991e90d40ef7.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/7cb05595452a2c1ea383991e90d40ef7.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/7cb05595452a2c1ea383991e90d40ef7.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A continuation of the story with an enthralling plot brimming with mysteries and high stakes. Our beloved characters return, while new ones help reveal a different side of the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/2b98c1d3f0d8273c0ab7c641820752ae.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/2b98c1d3f0d8273c0ab7c641820752ae.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/2b98c1d3f0d8273c0ab7c641820752ae.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The re-engineered and enhanced combat system lets you use both hands at once. Glove abilities can be combined with various melee and ranged weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/9533b683dbdf065e411f7b3df88ce452.poster.avif?t=1749814046\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/9533b683dbdf065e411f7b3df88ce452.webm?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/9533b683dbdf065e411f7b3df88ce452.mp4?t=1749814046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the magnificent world of science and technology, and find out what the next chapter has in store for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788800/extras/0afa7525c098a449fe8019ea6d6b785f.avif?t=1749814046\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p>",
